    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mesmerizing survival game with a unique atmosphere. Survive in a city that has been hit by a nuclear strike.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive in a world where there was a nuclear explosion? There is radiation, hunger, disease and suffering all around you. Your goal is to escape from the dying city and find the love of your youth. A unique atmosphere and a poignant storyline. Uncover the mystery of the missing documents and make a choice: save the people around you or leave them to perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you in the game: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/a9f61d90436a6d065e9901f9a4d9b03b.poster.avif?t=1746595842\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/a9f61d90436a6d065e9901f9a4d9b03b.webm?t=1746595842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Unique story. Along the way, you will find many stories of different people, fascinating puzzle quests and the right to choose during the passage of quests.<br><br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/e643cf702bf512148ffd931e07d30317.poster.avif?t=1746595842\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/e643cf702bf512148ffd931e07d30317.webm?t=1746595842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Hard survival. You will be haunted by typical survivor problems such as hunger, disease, thirst, the gradually approaching nuclear winter and bandits. Eliminate enemies to survive and avoid unnecessary attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/27ac2ae58a0143763907d1752e6ac54b.poster.avif?t=1746595842\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/27ac2ae58a0143763907d1752e6ac54b.webm?t=1746595842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Dynamic game world. In the game world, weather conditions, the alignment of forces of groups of people outside, and so on will change. Get a loyal companion who will help you in your search and protect you from danger.  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/03fc82ddf978dd01e6e7e411d41cfc2b.poster.avif?t=1746595842\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/03fc82ddf978dd01e6e7e411d41cfc2b.webm?t=1746595842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Fistfights. Engage in fierce duels with other survivors, where only strength and agility decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demo Version Is Available Now.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mesmerizing survival game with a unique atmosphere. Survive in a city that has been hit by a nuclear strike.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive in a world where there was a nuclear explosion? There is radiation, hunger, disease and suffering all around you. Your goal is to escape from the dying city and find the love of your youth. A unique atmosphere and a poignant storyline. Uncover the mystery of the missing documents and make a choice: save the people around you or leave them to perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you in the game: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/a9f61d90436a6d065e9901f9a4d9b03b.poster.avif?t=1746595842\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/a9f61d90436a6d065e9901f9a4d9b03b.webm?t=1746595842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Unique story. Along the way, you will find many stories of different people, fascinating puzzle quests and the right to choose during the passage of quests.<br><br>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/e643cf702bf512148ffd931e07d30317.poster.avif?t=1746595842\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/e643cf702bf512148ffd931e07d30317.webm?t=1746595842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Hard survival. You will be haunted by typical survivor problems such as hunger, disease, thirst, the gradually approaching nuclear winter and bandits. Eliminate enemies to survive and avoid unnecessary attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/27ac2ae58a0143763907d1752e6ac54b.poster.avif?t=1746595842\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/27ac2ae58a0143763907d1752e6ac54b.webm?t=1746595842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Dynamic game world. In the game world, weather conditions, the alignment of forces of groups of people outside, and so on will change. Get a loyal companion who will help you in your search and protect you from danger.  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/03fc82ddf978dd01e6e7e411d41cfc2b.poster.avif?t=1746595842\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2747650/extras/03fc82ddf978dd01e6e7e411d41cfc2b.webm?t=1746595842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Fistfights. Engage in fierce duels with other survivors, where only strength and agility decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Demo Version Is Available Now.</p>",
